<!--
  askru.in — 3 Nov 2026.

  🔴 EVERY URL HERE CARRIES `index, follow`, CHECKED ONE BY ONE BEFORE LISTING.
  A sitemap that submits a noindex page earns "Submitted URL marked noindex" in
  Search Console, which is a defect found on teatalz.com/sitemap.xml the same
  day: it still submits /askru/, /askru/kundli-milan/ and /askru/choghadiya/,
  all three of which went noindex when the content moved here.

  SO THIS FILE LISTS THREE URLS AND NOT EIGHT. The repo holds eight HTML pages;
  five are `noindex` and stay out — investor.html, investordashboard/,
  foundersden/, founderden.html (a redirect stub) and paid.html (the payment hop
  page, which nobody should ever reach from a search result).

  ⚠️ `lastmod` IS TAKEN FROM GIT, NOT TYPED. `git log -1 --format=%cs -- <file>`
  for each page. A date somebody types is not a date the file was changed, and a
  lastmod that is wrong in the optimistic direction teaches a crawler to ignore
  the field.

  ⚠️ AND /muhurat/ IS ABSENT BECAUSE IT DOES NOT EXIST. It returns 404. The
  muhurat engine went to production on 3 Nov (v20, with the lunar-month,
  Kharmas, Hasta and part-day-window rules) and is reachable from the app only.
  Do not add the URL here before the page is live: a 404 in a sitemap is worse
  than an absence, because it is a claim.
-->
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  <url>
    <loc>https://askru.in/</loc>
    <lastmod>2026-11-12</lastmod>
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>1.0</priority>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>https://askru.in/kundli-milan/</loc>
    <lastmod>2026-11-12</lastmod>
    <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.8</priority>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>https://askru.in/choghadiya/</loc>
    <lastmod>2026-11-12</lastmod>
    <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.8</priority>
  </url>
</urlset>
